00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,266
Question ten. Highlight: some fields are “required”; before submit the system checks they “have content” and “must not be blank”.

2
00:00:09,266 --> 00:00:13,647
Useful: checking that something was entered = presence check.

3
00:00:13,647 --> 00:00:18,603
Useless: inter-school contest theme — does not change the check type.

4
00:00:18,603 --> 00:00:20,901
Option A. Presence check — keep.

5
00:00:20,901 --> 00:00:25,427
Option B. Range check: numeric bounds; stem has no range — cut.

6
00:00:25,427 --> 00:00:30,383
Option C. Type check: correct data type; stem focuses on blank — cut.

7
00:00:30,383 --> 00:00:34,764
Option D. Check digit: checksum maths; not in the stem — cut.

8
00:00:34,764 --> 00:00:37,278
Must not be blank = presence check.

9
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:39,720
Therefore the correct answer is A.

